in @prism
in @meta
in @epistemologic
in @epistemologic/reality
in @epistemologic/reality/silicon

# @epistemologic/reality/silicon/arch — ISA + microarch family root.
#
# Names the architecture-carrier species under @epistemologic/reality/silicon.
# Each carrier under this root specializes the ISA / extensions / vendor /
# microarch / pointer-width record at one ISA family.
#
# Species under this family:
#
#   @epistemologic/reality/silicon/arch/arm64    ARM64 carrier. ISA gen +
#                                                NEON / SVE / SVE2 / AMX /
#                                                BF16 / FP16 / crypto.
#   @epistemologic/reality/silicon/arch/x86_64   x86_64 carrier. SSE2 /
#                                                AVX / AVX2 / AVX-512 /
#                                                VNNI / BMI / AES-NI.
#
# Substrate-pull placement (2026-06-06, Mara's reality family migration):
# the arch directory existed as a bare directory before this tick; the
# family root is added here for symmetry with the species-of-reality
# pattern (each directory under reality/ that holds carriers gets a
# matching .mirror declaration; cf. shards/epistemologic/reality/silicon.mirror).
# Path-namespace property: this file at
# `shards/epistemologic/reality/silicon/arch.mirror` declares
# `@epistemologic/reality/silicon/arch` and only that.

out @epistemologic/reality/silicon/arch
